{c: Verse 1}
[E]Mai agar si [C#m]taro se churake lau [A]roshni,        [B]Hawaonse churake laun [C#m]raagini
Na [A]poori ho sakegi un [G#]se magar teri kami
[E]Mai agar na [C#m]zaro se churake lau [A]rangate
[B]Mazaaron se chura ke laaun [C#m]barqatein
Na [A]poori ho sakegi un [G#]se magar teri kami
Yeh [E]duniya paraayi hai,        [C#m]Bas ek apna hai [A]tu [B]
Jo [E]sach ho mera woh,        [C#m]Savere ka sapna hai [A]tu [B]
[E]Dekhunga [C#m]tera raas [A]ta [B],        [E]Ho kuch tu [C#m]jhe bas Khuda [A]na khas [E]ta
[E]Tere bina umrr [C#m]ke safar mein,        Ba [A]da hi tanha hoon [B]main
[E]Raftaar jo waqt [C#m]ki pakad na sa [A]ke,        Woh lamha hoon [B]main
Fagun ke ma [E]hine [C#m]tere bina hai [A]phike [B]
Jo tu nahi to [E]sare [C#m]sawan mere [A]sukhe [B]
[E]Mai agar ki [C#m]tabose chura ke laun [A]qayde,        [B]Hisaabon se chura ke laaun [C#m]faayde
Na [A]poori ho sakegi un [G#]se magar teri kami
[E]Mai agar si [C#m]taro se churake lau [A]roshni,        [B]Hawaaon se chura ke laaun [C#m]raagini
